# dagim v1

node gumbo-pot-combine-butter-white-rice-flour: In gumbo pot, combine 1/2 cup butter and 1/2 cup white rice flour

node prepare-rice-cooker-press-start: Prepare rice in rice cooker and press start

node put-hot-water-chicken-pot: Put two quarts of hot water in the chicken pot
  parent gumbo-pot-combine-butter-white-rice-flour  # In gumbo pot, combine 1/2 cup butter and 1/2 cup white rice...

node put-chicken-thighs-pot: Put two pounds of chicken thighs in the chicken pot
  parent gumbo-pot-combine-butter-white-rice-flour  # In gumbo pot, combine 1/2 cup butter and 1/2 cup white rice...

node cook-medium-heat-stirring-dark-brown-roux: Cook over medium heat, frequently stirring to make a dark brown roux, about 15 minutes
  parent gumbo-pot-combine-butter-white-rice-flour  # In gumbo pot, combine 1/2 cup butter and 1/2 cup white rice...

node slice-andouille-sausage: Slice 12 ounces Andouille sausage
  parent put-hot-water-chicken-pot  # Put two quarts of hot water in the chicken pot
  parent put-chicken-thighs-pot  # Put two pounds of chicken thighs in the chicken pot

node bring-water-to-boil: Bring water to boil
  parent put-hot-water-chicken-pot  # Put two quarts of hot water in the chicken pot
  parent put-chicken-thighs-pot  # Put two pounds of chicken thighs in the chicken pot
